{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"main_base_l7","model_identifier":"main_base_l7","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# main_base_l7\n\nMain base level 7, Fortified Keep: the keep and wings ringed by a stone curtain wall with corner towers, arrow slits and an iron-banded gate.\n\n- Footprint: 14 x 14 columns (224 x 224 units, 6.30 x 6.30 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -118..118, y 0..221, z -118..118 units.\n- Texture: 512 x 1024, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 461, construction_0 52, construction_33 146, construction_66 348, ruined 281 (10 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- keep: 84 x 224 x 84 centred at the origin\n- curtain wall: 224 x 96 x 224 ring, 8 u thick (inner court open)\n- corner towers: 36 x 118 x 36 at the four corners\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `main_base_l7_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `main_base_l7_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_main_base_l7` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -49)\n- `slot_balcony` at (0, 153, -48)\n- `slot_parapet_1` at (-17, 213, -34)\n- `slot_parapet_2` at (17, 213, -34)\n- `slot_parapet_3` at (34, 213, -17)\n- `slot_parapet_4` at (34, 213, 17)\n- `slot_parapet_5` at (17, 213, 34)\n- `slot_parapet_6` at (-17, 213, 34)\n- `slot_parapet_7` at (-34, 213, 17)\n- `slot_parapet_8` at (-34, 213, -17)\n- `slot_tower_1` at (-98, 121, -98)\n- `slot_tower_2` at (98, 121, -98)\n- `slot_tower_3` at (-98, 121, 98)\n- `slot_tower_4` at (98, 121, 98)\n- `slot_gate` at (0, 0, -122)\n"},"resolution":{"width":512,"height":1024},"elements":[{"name":"keep_base","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-42.0,0.0,-42.0],"to":[42.0,6.0,42.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[246.0,592.0,330.0,598.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[246.0,592.0,330.0,598.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[246.0,592.0,330.0,598.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[246.0,592.0,330.0,598.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,334.0,84.0,418.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,334.0,84.0,418.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"b7acb33d-e833-55c7-9e95-5499fbf3d72f"},{"name":"keep_body","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-40.0,6.0,-40.0],"to":[40.0,210.0,40.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[36.0,0.0,116.0,204.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[36.0,0.0,116.0,204.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[36.0,0.0,116.0,204.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[36.0,0.0,116.0,204.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[217.0,334.0,297.0,414.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[217.0,334.0,297.0,414.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"32f0740f-8cda-5be2-95ae-5712cb97dd23"},{"name":"keep_slit00","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,